1  | ∀x (P(x) → Q(x))
2  | ∀x (Q(x) → R(x))
   |----
3  | | [a]
   | |----
4  | | P(a) → Q(a)            ∀ Elim: 1
5  | | Q(a) → R(a)            ∀ Elim: 2
6  | | | P(a)
   | | |----
7  | | | Q(a)                 → Elim: 4,6
8  | | | R(a)                 → Elim: 5,7
9  | | P(a) → R(a)            → Intro: 6-8
10 | ∀x (P(x) → R(x))         ∀ Intro: 3-9
